{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10122210","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10122210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:6:1012221001:1":{"text":"얘들아, 이 누나가 가져온 약초는 안심하고 먹어도 돼. 열심히 먹으면, 아픈 게 싹 사라질 거야.","source_cn":"孩子们，这位姐姐带来的草药可以放心服用，乖乖吃下去，病...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBCC6B90FEC2762A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012221002:1":{"text":"그치만 약은 너무 쓴데…","source_cn":"老师都这么说的话……可是，草药很苦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41CCB6AF0B30E0C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012221003:0":{"text":"걱정 마! 다 먹으면 내가 제일 좋아하는 사탕을 줄게!","source_cn":"别怕！只要你喝完药，我就把最喜欢的糖果给你吃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF5857F7B7D8674B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012221004:1":{"text":"약을 안 먹으면 배가 더 아플 거야. 선생님 말씀 들어.","source_cn":"再不喝药，肚子会更痛，你最好听老师的话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x216BC7AF92DA9C5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012221005:1":{"text":"흑… 알았어…\n꿀꺽꿀꺽... 역시 써!","source_cn":"呜……好吧……\\n咕嘟咕嘟——果然很苦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4CDAAEC9B99F82B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1012221006:1":{"text":"그치만… 배가 따뜻해졌어. 속이 편안해…","source_cn":"不过……肚子暖暖的，很舒服……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A2B3DF9278390C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1012221007:0":{"text":"방금 약을 먹었으니까 돌아다니지 말고, 나무 아래로 가서 잠시 쉬렴. 선생님은 손님들에게 감사 인사를 해야겠어.","source_cn":"刚吃完药，不要乱跑，你们去树下歇息一会儿吧。老师要向客...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E572CE1CC2FF83F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1012221008:1":{"text":"하임 할머니가 말한 선생님이 역시 너였구나. 오랜만이야, 프라벨.","source_cn":"茴姆婆婆说的那位老师果然是你。好久不见，芙拉贝尔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C6D9294015C5515","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1012221009:0":{"text":"에이론, 검도를 수행하는 여정이 순조롭지 않나봐? 얼굴에 그늘이 드리워 있어.","source_cn":"埃隆，修行剑道的旅途不太顺利吗？你的眼中蒙着一层阴影呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F2FDC796AAA7028","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1012221010:0":{"text":"…말하자니 부끄럽네.","source_cn":"……说来惭愧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BB87F3330CEA847","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1012221011:0":{"text":"프라벨, 알면서 일부러 묻는 거야? 땅거미 숲에 큰일이 일어났다는 걸 눈치챘을 텐데… 안 그러면 우리가 왜 바투소 산맥까지 왔겠어?","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔，你这是明知故问吗？你应该猜到薄暮丛林出事了…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x105B16F176A87045","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1012221012:0":{"text":"라이카, 오랜만인데 인사도 제대로 안 하는 거야? 하아… 졸업하고 나니까 선배가 눈에 안 보인다 이거지?","source_cn":"莱卡，许久没见，你都不和我好好打个招呼。唉……毕业后，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55778AF0FC29963C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1012221013:0":{"text":"학교 다닐 때가 그립다. 그땐 내가 제일 좋다며 강아지처럼 하루 종일 따라다녔잖아.","source_cn":"真怀念上学那会儿，那时候你最喜欢我跟着我，就像是鬼针草...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA074DCBD7E2E27C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1012221014:0":{"text":"뭐... 뭐래... 단단히 잘못 기억하고 있네...","source_cn":"你记错了吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x547C37D05152B7A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1012221015:0":{"text":"아… 그래. 항상 내 위에 엎드려 울던 걸 깜빡할 뻔했어.","source_cn":"嗯……也对，我差点忘了你总是趴在我身上哭的事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48E4058D25D80D17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},